{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death and Ladders:\u00a0Roll the dice, climb the ladders, avoid scythes, take risky shortcuts, use Tarot Ability Cards to improve your odds or trap your opponent. Reach the end first to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are supposed to die, but Death is bored to death doing the same job for an eternity. So he gave you a chance to win back your life, if you entertain him by playing his board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamble your soul in a relaxing atmosphere amongst a Skeleton crew, or if you want more of a challenge, try your luck against other unfortunate souls in Online or Local PVP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core is Random:</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425390/extras/Gif_Test-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742407706\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core of the game is rolling dice, with the goal of climbing to the top of the board.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you end your turn at the start of a ladder, you climb to higher ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you end your turn at the top of a scythe, you go to it's bottom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can risk taking optional shortcuts, but if you don't roll exactly what you need, the turn will be wasted</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tarot Cards Improve Your Odds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425390/extras/GIF_Cards-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742407706\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start of each turn you will get a certain amount of Tarot Ability Cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use those cards to improve your odds, or trap your opponent.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Play the Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425390/86d25b02e370345edb79436e42e4f01ebf1ab373.jpg"},{"name":"The Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425390/5aa9f8dd59263c282f6b4eb6357a5898de6247f7.jpg"},{"name":"The Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425390/86a7fe5c69fa4ac09da056fc55acc10b8eab6c32.jpg"},{"name":"The Fool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425390/e3567de6c801edbd4bf291a2ff35495d3b23bd14.jpg"},{"name":"Justice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425390/894284ef5f663d9eb6662c89842bb06a71fab162.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3425390?t=1742407706","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742407706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425390/49e828f680e71b85d91e18aa5e4741ab13dc0317/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742407706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425390/49e828f680e71b85d91e18aa5e4741ab13dc0317/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742407706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death and Ladders:\u00a0Roll the dice, climb the ladders, avoid scythes, take risky shortcuts, use Tarot Ability Cards to